        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Friedkin, Jon Paul Puno\n- Roles: film director, producer, screenwriter, filmmaker\n- Works: The French Connection, The Exorcist, Peace Grows, Valle de Lágrimas\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Director\n\nFacts:\n- Jon Paul Puno directed the film Peace Grows in 2004.\n- Jon Paul Puno directed the film Valle de Lágrimas in 2006.\n- William Friedkin directed The French Connection in 1971 and won the Academy Award for Best Director for that film.\n- William Friedkin directed The Exorcist in 1973.\n- William Friedkin, born on August 29, 1935, is an American film director, producer, and screenwriter best known for The French Connection and The Exorcist.",
